github.setup        KDAB KDDockWidgets 2.5.1 v
github.tarball_from archive
name                kddockwidgets
revision            0
categories          devel aqua
license             GPL-2 GPL-3
maintainers         {gmail.com:audvare @Tatsh} openmaintainer
description         Advanced docking system for Qt widgets.
long_description    KDDockWidgets is a Qt dock widget library by KDAB, suitable for replacing \
                    QDockWidget and implementing advanced functionality missing in Qt. This port \
                    builds the Qt 6 QtWidgets frontend.
homepage            https://github.com/KDAB/KDDockWidgets

